# Generated data -- every CSV here is produced by the pipeline, not authored.
# telemetry.csv (4.5 MB), detections.csv (2.9 MB), scores.csv (1.8 MB) and
# window_metadata.csv (1.2 MB) all regenerate deterministically from
# RANDOM_SEED in config.py.
*.csv

