# Separate research tracks, not part of NavIC Pulse. Excluded entirely: both
# carry data far past what belongs in this repo -- esa/ is ~8.1 GB and holds
# two .npy arrays over GitHub's 100 MB file limit, galileo/ is ~252 MB of
# downloaded MGEX clock products. Give them their own repos if they need
# version control.
esa/
galileo/
